        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 53 for SLE 12 SP5)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for the Linux Kernel 4.12.14-122_194 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2024-35789: wifi: mac80211: check/clear fast rx for non-4addr sta VLAN changes (bsc#1227320).\n- CVE-2021-47511: ALSA: pcm: oss: fix negative period/buffer sizes (bsc#1227700).\n- CVE-2024-53104: media: uvcvideo: Skip parsing frames of type UVC_VS_UNDEFINED in uvc_parse_format (bsc#1236783).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "details",
        "text": "SUSE-2025-667,SUSE-SLE-Live-Patching-12-SP5-2025-667",
